OpenUUYC Copyright, Provenance and License Notice

1. Nature of the project

OpenUUYC is an independent third-party client that implements protocol
compatibility and platform adaptation in Rust, based on reverse-engineering
analysis of the UU Remote client and its communication behavior. The project
aims to support multiple platforms; actual support is described in the
information accompanying each release.

The project name, publication of source code, and functional compatibility do
not imply authorization, certification, sponsorship, or endorsement by NetEase.
This project does not represent the official UU Remote product and does not
grant authorization to use its official services.

